<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CROWN CORK RAISED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CROWN CORK RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Crown Cork &amp; Seal Co Inc and added it to the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- the stock was previously rated a market outperformer.</p>
<p>-- Crown Cork &amp; Seal gained 1-1/8 to 53-5/8.</p>
